2360;&#2306;&#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2344;\r\n&#2310;&#2357;&#2306;&#2335;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375;\r\n&#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366;\r\n&#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;\r\n&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340;\r\n&#2360;&#2350;&#2351;-&#2360;&#2368;&#2350;&#2366;\r\n&#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340;\r\n&#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2361;\r\n&#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2370;&#2306;&#2404;\n(Ends)"],["Reply","No Reply"]],"links":[{"label":"Official source","url":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/memberGetdata/Get_SpecialMentionmemberwise?mpcode=2577"}]},{"title":"Demand to release funds for National Health Mission for West Bengal","date":"2024-02-07","details":[["Date","07/02/2024"],["Session","263"],["Ministry","FINANCE"],["Statement","Shri Prakash\r\nChik Baraik: Funds under the National Health Mission (NHM) have\r\nbecome a point of concern in West Bengal. The State Government has allocated a\r\nsignificant Rs 1,300 crore in the current fiscal year, while the Centres\r\ncontribution remains at Rs 280 crore. The Union is reportedly yet to release around\r\nRs 826.72 crore earmarked for constructing Suswasthya Kendras (health and\r\nwellness centres) across Bengal. \nThe\r\nUnion Government cited non-compliance with specific color-branding guidelines\r\nfor Health and Wellness Centres. In West Bengal, government hospitals provide\r\nfree tests, treatments, and medications, and the Swasthya Sathi health\r\ninsurance scheme covers 2.5 crore families, benefiting 45 lakh individuals. The\r\nnumber of medical colleges has significantly increased from 10 in 2011 to 33. \nWith\r\naround 11,000 centres benefiting three lakh people daily in Bengal, it is\r\ncrucial for the Central Government to reassess its position, eliminate\r\ncolor-branding requirements, and promptly release essential funds for the\r\nNational Health Mission.\n(Ends)"],["Reply","No Reply"]],"links":[{"label":"Official source","url":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/memberGetdata/Get_SpecialMentionmemberwise?mpcode=2577"}]}]}